# Was in Russian: был, была, было
subtitle: "Say where you were yesterday in Russian: was is был, была́, бы́ло or бы́ли, copying the end of он, она́, оно́ and они́, and drank is пил or пила́."
thumb: "band \"Even was has a gender\" note \"она́ была́\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"I like it in Russian: мне нравится","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/19-russian-like.cast"}

