    card title Was

A: How do you say was in Russian? Start with today: Сего́дня па́па в рестора́не.
    draw p_dad s_today

A: Dad is in the restaurant, and there's no word for is.
    draw g_today

B: Now yesterday, вчера́: Вчера́ па́па был в рестора́не.
    draw s_past g_past

A: Yesterday dad was in the restaurant. Russian has no is, but it does have was: был.
    highlight s_past part был color #c9871a

B: Вчера́ ма́ма была́ на мо́ре: yesterday mum was at the seaside.
    draw p_mum s_mumrow g_mum

A: Па́па and ма́ма both end in а, but dad is он and mum is она́: so mum gets была́.
    highlight s_mumrow part была́ color #c9871a

    erase page1

A: It's the game from lesson two. With он, was is был, ending in a bare consonant, like он itself: па́па был.
    draw r_m

B: With она́, it's была́, ending in а, like она́: ма́ма была́.
    draw r_f

A: With оно́, it's бы́ло, ending in о, like оно́: молоко́ бы́ло.
    draw r_n

B: And with они́, the plurals of lesson eleven, it's бы́ли, ending in и, like они́: коты́ бы́ли.
    draw r_p

A: So was copies the end of he, she, it and they: был, была́, бы́ло, бы́ли.
    highlight v_m v_f v_n v_p effect pulse color #c9871a

    hide board

A: And with я or ты? Then it goes by the person: a man or a woman.
    draw speakers

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: I'm a man, so my я takes был: я был.
    highlight talk_2_words part был color #c9871a

B: And I'm a woman, so I say я была́.
    highlight talk_3_words part была́ color #c9871a

    erase talk speakers

A: Пил and пила́ mean drank.
    draw c_pit

A: They come from пить, to drink, as in а пить? at the café.
    draw c_pit_g

A: Take off the ть, add л, and then the same endings as before.
    highlight c_pit part ть$ color #c9871a

B: Был comes from быть, to be, in just the same way.
    draw c_byt c_byt_g

    hide vcard

    draw sort

    ask "Which was goes with each word? Put it under был, была́, бы́ло or бы́ли." on sort store s stage own voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: {s} right on the first try: стол был, сестра́ была́, мо́ре бы́ло, кни́ги бы́ли.
        wrong: {s} of {s.total} on the first try: стол был, сестра́ была́, мо́ре бы́ло, кни́ги бы́ли.

    erase sort

    draw q2

    quiz "Сестра́ и брат ___ на мо́ре. Which was fills the gap?" reveal.text "бы́ли на мо́ре" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: A sister and a brother are two people, они́, so it's бы́ли.
        wrong: How many people were at the seaside?
        * был
        * была́
        + бы́ли

    erase q2 question_2_stamp

    draw q3

    ask "Masha had tea yesterday. Type the missing word: Вчера́ я ___ чай." answer ["пила́","пила"] reveal.text "Вчера́ я пила́ чай." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 54 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Masha is a woman, so drank ends in а: пила́.
        wrong: Masha is a she: which ending goes with она́?

    erase q3 question_3_stamp

    draw q4

    quiz "Ко́шка ___ на окне́. Which was fills the gap?" reveal.text "ко́шка была́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Ко́шка ends in а, so she's она́, and she была́ на окне́.
        wrong: Is ко́шка он or она́?
        * был
        + была́
        * бы́ло

    erase q4 question_4_stamp

    draw q5_text

    quiz "What does Вчера́ коты́ бы́ли тут mean?" say_answer false reveal.text "= yesterday the cats were here" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 46 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Вчера́ is yesterday, and коты́ бы́ли is the cats were: more than one, so и.
        wrong: Is it today or yesterday, and one cat or more?
        + Yesterday the cats were here
        * Today the cats are here
        * Yesterday the cat was here

    erase q5_text question_5_stamp

    group score_side members ["sc_dad","sc_dad_t","sc_mum","sc_mum_t"]
    parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase score_side

    show board

A: So in the past the verb tells you who: hear я была́, and you know the speaker is a woman.
    highlight v_m v_f v_n v_p effect box color #c9871a

    hide board

B: Вчера́ я была́ на мо́ре, а сего́дня я тут. Пока́!
    icon e_masha size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 540 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    text e_say "Вчера́ я была́ на мо́ре," #3d3833 say "Вчера я была на море, а сегодня я тут. Пока!" say_voice b x 500 y 410 font_size 52
    text e_say2 "а сего́дня я тут. Пока́!" #3d3833 say "Вчера я была на море, а сегодня я тут. Пока!" say_voice b x 500 y 340 font_size 52
    text e_g "Yesterday I was at the seaside; today I'm here. Bye!" #8f887c x 500 y 275 font_size 30

